{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_0_level_main_00-09_end","groupId":"main_0","stageId":"main_00-09","title":"臨光","storyCode":"0-9","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-09_end.txt","sourceHash":"053de5fae7b22954c04e324bce61835cae4aea7c6b414ae2f68326256b07809d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"梅菲斯特擁有與他的狂妄相匹的實力。在他的指揮下，羅德島小隊竟顯出頹勢。\n危急時刻，耀騎士臨光，及時趕到。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第五关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_5"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"咿——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事，只是擦傷而已，不要緊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"還不夠......再這樣下去，包圍圈會越來越小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經找到了可突破口，但沒有增援，我們只能採取守勢，沒法突圍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......請再堅持一下！優先用火力壓制敵方射手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人的先鋒，就由我們術師來處理！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，沒錯！就該這樣！接下來，f3，e5！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"可憎的小子......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"很好！那麼，b4，b5！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人正在向我們側後方迂回！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"調兩位重裝幹員和一位狙擊幹員！只要能牽制他們就足夠了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"之後！h2，h6！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"他們，他們在衝擊我們的陣線！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛幹員，把敵人趕出掩體！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，再讓我多看一會兒，你們掙扎的樣子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，術師，c7，吃掉敵人的戰車吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人的術師現身了......！之前，一直躲在重裝幹員身後嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"來不及了！趴下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚啊啊啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"然後就去死吧，就像雨夜中的火星一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"他，是在指揮自己的隊伍嗎......！僅僅運用象棋走法，就能下達精準的命令？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"明明都是些狂暴的感染者，戰鬥卻完全由他一人指揮......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"再這樣下去，他會把指揮優勢發揮到極致——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"相應的，只要能壓制他的話，也就沒什麼大不了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"不要讓整合運動打開哪怕一丁點缺口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"混帳，我們的時間越來越少了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不能再讓整合運動拖延我們的腳步了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼，有什麼辦法能迅速打開局面嗎......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果繼續拖下去，博士和大家就......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔唔唔唔啊啊啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔唔......怎麼回事？怎麼有人被......撞飛起來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的速度比我估算的慢上太多了，我可是連平民都順手安頓好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"別擋路！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"加大進攻力度！別給敵人重整陣形的機會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"臨光小姐！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒事就好，阿米婭。快撤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"幸虧這次作戰，有你參加。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"訊號彈的定位很有效。看來你們遇到的麻煩確實不小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"您就是{@nickname}博士吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"耀騎士臨光，前來迎接你們了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["近衛幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["醫療幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜賓"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["？？？","臨光"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["梅菲斯特"]}]}
